{"seq":3,"slug":"assets-measurement-depreciation","title":"大学会计学 — 资产计量与折旧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/financial-accounting/assets-measurement-depreciation","wordCount":1925,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学会计学-资产计量与折旧\">大学会计学 — 资产计量与折旧</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>资产是企业拥有或控制、预期带来经济利益的资源，但一个看似简单的问题却暗藏玄机：资产在报表上应该按多少钱列示？是按当初购买的价格，还是按现在的市场价？这就是&quot;资产计量&quot;问题。会计提供了多种计量属性，其中最基础的是&quot;历史成本&quot;——按取得资产时实际支付的金额入账，因为它客观、可验证。但历史成本也有局限，于是准则在特定情形下引入了公允价值、可变现净值等其他属性。</p>\n<p>对于厂房、设备这类能用很多年的&quot;长期资产&quot;，还有一个核心问题：一台用十年的机器，不能在购买当年就把全部成本算作费用，否则会严重扭曲各年利润。会计的解决方案是&quot;折旧&quot;——把长期资产的成本，系统、合理地分摊到它能创造收益的各个期间。折旧是配比原则在长期资产上的具体应用，也是理解利润表的又一把关键钥匙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"资产的计量属性\">资产的计量属性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计量属性</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>历史成本</td>\n<td>取得时实际支付的金额</td>\n<td>大多数资产的初始计量（存货、固定资产）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公允价值</td>\n<td>市场参与者交易的价格</td>\n<td>交易性金融资产、投资性房地产（选用时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可变现净值</td>\n<td>预计售价减相关费用</td>\n<td>存货减值测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现值</td>\n<td>未来现金流的折现值</td>\n<td>长期应收款、减值测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>历史成本之所以成为基石，是因为它有原始凭证支撑、不易操纵。但当资产价值明显下跌时，继续按历史成本列示会高估资产，因此准则要求进行&quot;减值测试&quot;：当资产可收回金额低于账面价值时，要计提减值准备。例如存货市价跌破成本时计提&quot;存货跌价准备&quot;，这体现了会计的&quot;谨慎性原则&quot;——预计的损失要确认，预计的收益不能提前确认。</p>\n<h3 id=\"折旧-长期资产成本的分摊\">折旧：长期资产成本的分摊</h3><p>折旧涉及三个要素：<strong>原值</strong>（资产的取得成本）、<strong>预计净残值</strong>（报废时预计能收回的残余价值）、<strong>预计使用年限</strong>。折旧的基数是&quot;应计折旧总额 = 原值 - 预计净残值&quot;。常用的折旧方法有三种：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 直线法（年限平均法）</strong>——最常用，每年折旧额相等：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>年折旧额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>原值</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>预计净残值</mtext></mrow><mtext>预计使用年限</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">年折旧额 = \\frac{原值 - 预计净残值}{预计使用年限}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年折旧额</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预计使用年限</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原值</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预计净残值</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例：一台设备原值 100000 元，预计净残值 10000 元，使用 5 年。则年折旧额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>18000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\frac{100000 - 10000}{5} = 18000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100000</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">10000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18000</span></span></span></span></span> 元。每年都提 18000，直到第 5 年末账面价值降至残值 10000。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 双倍余额递减法</strong>——加速折旧，前期多提、后期少提，不考虑残值直到最后两年：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>年折旧率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mtext>预计使用年限</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">年折旧率 = \\frac{2}{预计使用年限} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年折旧率</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预计使用年限</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>仍用上例，年折旧率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\frac{2}{5} = 40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>。第一年折旧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>100000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 100000 \\times 40\\% = 40000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40000</span></span></span></span></span>，第二年 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>40000</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= (100000 - 40000) \\times 40\\% = 24000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">100000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40000</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24000</span></span></span></span></span>，依此递减，最后两年改用直线法把剩余净值（扣残值）摊完。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 年数总和法</strong>——也是加速折旧，以剩余使用年数为权重。第一年权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{5}{1+2+3+4+5} = \\frac{5}{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，逐年递减。</p>\n<p>三种方法各年折旧额对比（原值 100000、残值 10000、5 年）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>直线法</th>\n<th>双倍余额递减法</th>\n<th>年数总和法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第1年</td>\n<td>18000</td>\n<td>40000</td>\n<td>30000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第2年</td>\n<td>18000</td>\n<td>24000</td>\n<td>24000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第3年</td>\n<td>18000</td>\n<td>14400</td>\n<td>18000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第4年</td>\n<td>18000</td>\n<td>6800</td>\n<td>12000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第5年</td>\n<td>18000</td>\n<td>4800</td>\n<td>6000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合计</td>\n<td>90000</td>\n<td>90000</td>\n<td>90000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：无论哪种方法，五年折旧总额都是 90000（即应计折旧总额），只是各年分布不同。加速折旧法让前期利润更低、后期更高，常用于技术更新快的设备（如芯片制造设备），也能在前期带来抵税好处。</p>\n<h3 id=\"折旧的会计处理与影响\">折旧的会计处理与影响</h3><p>每期计提折旧的分录是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"借：制造费用/管理费用（按资产用途）&#10;    贷：累计折旧\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>借：制造费用/管理费用（按资产用途）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：累计折旧</span></span></code></pre></div><p>&quot;累计折旧&quot;是固定资产的备抵账户，资产负债表上：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>固定资产净值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>固定资产原值</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>累计折旧</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">固定资产净值 = 固定资产原值 - 累计折旧</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">固定资产净值</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">固定资产原值</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">累计折旧</span></span></span></span></span>。值得强调的是，<strong>折旧是一笔不付现金的费用</strong>——计提折旧减少利润，但当期并不流出现金（现金在购买资产时早已支付）。这正是利润与现金流产生差异的重要原因之一，也解释了为什么现金流量表要把折旧&quot;加回&quot;经营活动现金流。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个折旧选择影响利润的真实启示\">一个折旧选择影响利润的真实启示</h3><p>折旧方法和年限的选择会显著影响利润，这给了企业一定的&quot;调节空间&quot;。航空公司就是典型例子：飞机价值数亿，使用年限假设差几年，每年折旧就相差巨大。若一家航司把飞机折旧年限从 20 年延长到 25 年，每年折旧费用下降，账面利润随之上升——但这并不意味着经营真的变好了。阅读财报时，关注折旧政策的变更，是识别利润&quot;水分&quot;的重要技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为什么历史成本是大多数资产的基础计量属性？它有什么优点和局限？谨慎性原则在资产减值中如何体现？</li>\n<li>某公司购入一台机器，原值 240000 元，预计净残值 20000 元，使用年限 4 年。分别用直线法和双倍余额递减法计算每年的折旧额。</li>\n<li>为什么说折旧是&quot;不付现金的费用&quot;？这一性质对理解利润与经营现金流的差异有什么意义？现金流量表为什么要把折旧加回？</li>\n<li>一家企业把固定资产折旧年限从 5 年延长到 8 年，对当期利润、累计折旧、固定资产净值分别有什么影响？这是否一定意味着经营改善？</li>\n<li>加速折旧法（如双倍余额递减法）相比直线法，在企业纳税和反映资产真实价值方面各有什么考量？哪类资产更适合加速折旧？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《企业会计准则第4号——固定资产》及第8号资产减值准则原文，了解折旧与减值的法定规则</li>\n<li>选两家航空公司的年报，对比它们的飞机折旧年限假设，体会会计估计对利润的影响</li>\n<li>《财务报表分析与证券估值》中关于资产计量与会计估计的章节</li>\n<li>实践建议：用 Excel 搭一张折旧计算表，输入原值、残值、年限，分别用三种方法自动生成各年折旧额，直观感受加速折旧与直线折旧的差异</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>资产计量以历史成本为基石，辅以公允价值、可变现净值等属性，并通过减值测试与谨慎性原则防止资产高估。折旧把长期资产成本系统分摊到受益期间，是配比原则的体现，常用直线法、双倍余额递减法和年数总和法，三者折旧总额相同而各年分布不同。折旧是不付现金的费用，是利润与现金流差异的重要来源。折旧政策的选择具有一定利润调节空间，需在分析时留意。至此第二章完成，下一章我们将站在投资者和分析师的角度，系统学习如何分析这些报表。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学会计学 — 资产计量与折旧","id":"大学会计学-资产计量与折旧"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"资产的计量属性","id":"资产的计量属性"},{"level":3,"text":"折旧：长期资产成本的分摊","id":"折旧-长期资产成本的分摊"},{"level":3,"text":"折旧的会计处理与影响","id":"折旧的会计处理与影响"},{"level":3,"text":"一个折旧选择影响利润的真实启示","id":"一个折旧选择影响利润的真实启示"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学会计学 — 权责发生制与收入确认","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/financial-accounting/revenue-recognition-accrual"},"next":{"title":"大学会计学 — 财务比率分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/financial-statements-analysis/financial-ratios"}}